{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2020-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1602115200, "end_date": 1602806399, "month_true_total": 124, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:47:53 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "77590303", "author": {"steamid": "76561198849019683", "personaname": "wubtoast", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198849019683/", "num_games_owned": 329, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1806, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 415, "last_played": 1721791507, "avatar": "7f0cda26e900a7e3a29b115d1eaa71c6e02c94b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Product of an affair with Doom and Risk of Rain.", "timestamp_created": 1602755973, "timestamp_updated": 1606419647, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77588824", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978092021", "personaname": "Papa Charlie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Canaeb/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 7205, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 354, "last_played": 1743084302, "avatar": "4e8f88ea8d29af45880d157d6bc0797ae4cf02c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is amazing, even in its current state. I'm not going to go into too much detail, but I'd highly suggest this game if you enjoy fast paced shooters. People compared this to Borderlands, but it feels a bit faster and the weapons have more impact in my opinion. I'd highly suggest giving this game a purchase, play through the current content, then wait for future updates.\n\nAs a side note, the developers know what they are doing. It's pretty clear in the way they interact with people on the the forums. These guys are going to do great things with this game.", "timestamp_created": 1602752994, "timestamp_updated": 1602752994, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77585148", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970420888", "personaname": "Tele_Chubbies", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970420888/", "num_games_owned": 3580, "num_reviews": 514, "playtime_forever": 201, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 201, "last_played": 1598420390, "avatar": "a6c70cee4fef564e603fb867ce7581feba045995"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent co-op/single player action fps.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDfse2k8Juw&t=2s", "timestamp_created": 1602745154, "timestamp_updated": 1602745154, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510978043079376221", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77577662", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989814336", "personaname": "Hex: Booty Tickles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197989814336/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 840, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 328, "last_played": 1646459231, "avatar": "235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is an absolute joy to play. It feels like a mix of Quake and Borderlands, put through a roguelite filter. The meta-progession is harmless and reasonable, no complaints. Even though (at time of writing on October 14th) the game only has through the second boss, there is great replay value and it's a hoot. Definitely recommended.\n\nMy only issues are that the textures are a seem unfinished and the enemies currently feel a tad static and repetitive. Seems extremely likely that these issues will be fixed with time. \n\nPS.\n\nScout is Best Girl", "timestamp_created": 1602728554, "timestamp_updated": 1602728554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528985500335693359", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77575421", "author": {"steamid": "76561198848483695", "personaname": "Foxtail", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198848483695/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 5846, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 770, "last_played": 1736700894, "avatar": "70a5d33544a60dd4858166edf34f0d5029a42048"}, "language": "english", "review": "YES YES YES!!!", "timestamp_created": 1602724177, "timestamp_updated": 1602724177, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}